{"items":[{"t":"C","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\ApprovalsServiceProvider","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/ApprovalsServiceProvider.html","d":"<p>Registers the config and migrations of the package.</p>","f":{"n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals.html"}},{"t":"T","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\ApprovesChanges","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/ApprovesChanges.html","d":"<p>Applied to the model that casts approvals/disapprovals on a Modification\n(e.g. your User model).</p>","f":{"n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns.html"}},{"t":"T","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\HasModificationMedia","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/HasModificationMedia.html","d":"<p>Optional: apply to a Modification subclass (which must also implement\nSpatie\\MediaLibrary\\HasMedia and <code>use InteractsWithMedia</code>) to allow\nattaching images to a pending change. Requires spatie/laravel-medialibrary,\nwhich this package does not depend on directly.</p>","f":{"n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns.html"}},{"t":"T","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html","d":"<p>Applied to the model whose changes should go through an approval workflow.</p>","f":{"n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns.html"}},{"t":"C","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts\\Approvable","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts/Approvable.html","d":"<p>Implemented by models that use the RequiresApprovalWhenChanges concern:\nmodels whose changes can be captured as a pending Modification instead\nof being saved directly.</p>","f":{"n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts.html"}},{"t":"C","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts\\Approver","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts/Approver.html","d":"<p>Implemented by models that use the ApprovesChanges concern: models that\ncan cast an approval/disapproval on a pending Modification.</p>","f":{"n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts.html"}},{"t":"C","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts\\GatesCreation","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts/GatesCreation.html","d":"<p>Implemented by models whose creation can need approval. They also use the\nRequiresApprovalWhenChanges concern, which handles the two available modes:</p>","f":{"n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts.html"}},{"t":"C","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Approval","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Approval.html","d":"<p>One approver's vote for a modification or one of its items.</p>","f":{"n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models.html"}},{"t":"C","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Disapproval","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Disapproval.html","d":"<p>One disapprover's vote against a modification or one of its items.</p>","f":{"n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models.html"}},{"t":"C","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html","d":"<p>A change to a model: an audit row if it was saved directly, or a request if it's waiting for approval.</p>","f":{"n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models.html"}},{"t":"C","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\ModificationItem","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/ModificationItem.html","d":"<p>A single decidable unit inside a Modification, used only when a model\nopts into per-field/per-group approval via approvableItemGroups(). A\nModification with no items is decided as a whole (legacy behavior).</p>","f":{"n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models.html"}},{"t":"C","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Scopes\\ApprovalDraftScope","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Scopes/ApprovalDraftScope.html","d":"<p>Hides rows waiting for their creation to be approved on models in draft mode.</p>","f":{"n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Scopes","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Scopes.html"}},{"t":"C","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Support\\ResolvesApprovalModels","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Support/ResolvesApprovalModels.html","d":"<p>Resolves the model classes to use for modifications/approvals/disapprovals,\nhonoring the <code>approvals.models.*</code> config so consuming apps can swap in\ntheir own subclasses without forking the package.</p>","f":{"n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Support","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Support.html"}},{"t":"C","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Support\\VoteNotApplied","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Support/VoteNotApplied.html","d":"<p>Undoes a whole decision from inside its transaction when one of its items couldn't be\napplied, so approve() can't leave a modification half decided. Never reaches the caller.</p>","f":{"n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Support","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Support.html"}},{"t":"I","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts\\Approvable","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts/Approvable.html","f":{"n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts.html"}},{"t":"I","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts\\Approver","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts/Approver.html","f":{"n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts.html"}},{"t":"I","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts\\GatesCreation","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts/GatesCreation.html","f":{"n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts.html"}},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\ApprovalsServiceProvider::register","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/ApprovalsServiceProvider.html#method_register","d":"<p>Merge the package config under the <code>approvals</code> key.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\ApprovalsServiceProvider::boot","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/ApprovalsServiceProvider.html#method_boot","d":"<p>Load the migrations, and offer them and the config for publishing.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\ApprovesChanges::authorizedToApprove","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/ApprovesChanges.html#method_authorizedToApprove","d":"<p>Whether this model may approve the change. Override it to add your rules.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\ApprovesChanges::authorizedToDisapprove","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/ApprovesChanges.html#method_authorizedToDisapprove","d":"<p>Whether this model may reject the change. Override it to add your rules.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\ApprovesChanges::approve","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/ApprovesChanges.html#method_approve","d":"<p>Vote to approve a modification, or every pending item if it has any.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\ApprovesChanges::disapprove","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/ApprovesChanges.html#method_disapprove","d":"<p>Vote to reject a modification, or every pending item if it has any.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\ApprovesChanges::approveItem","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/ApprovesChanges.html#method_approveItem","d":"<p>Vote to approve a single item, without touching the others.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\ApprovesChanges::disapproveItem","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/ApprovesChanges.html#method_disapproveItem","d":"<p>Vote to reject a single item, without touching the others.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\ApprovesChanges::approvals","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/ApprovesChanges.html#method_approvals","d":"<p>The approvals cast by this model.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\ApprovesChanges::disapprovals","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/ApprovesChanges.html#method_disapprovals","d":"<p>The disapprovals cast by this model.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\HasModificationMedia::registerMediaConversions","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/HasModificationMedia.html#method_registerMediaConversions","d":"<p>Register the <code>thumb</code> (300x200) and <code>normal</code> (800x600) image conversions.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\HasModificationMedia::addImage","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/HasModificationMedia.html#method_addImage","d":"<p>Attach an image to the <code>main</code> media collection.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\HasModificationMedia::imageLoad","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/HasModificationMedia.html#method_imageLoad","d":"<p>The name, the label and the URL of each requested size of an image.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::bootRequiresApprovalWhenChanges","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_bootRequiresApprovalWhenChanges","d":"<p>Register the model events that hold and audit saves.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::approversRequired","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_approversRequired","d":"<p>Approvers needed to apply a change. Override it to raise the number: the trait's property\ncan't be redeclared with another default on the class using the trait (PHP fatal error).</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::disapproversRequired","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_disapproversRequired","d":"<p>Disapprovers needed to reject a change. See approversRequired().</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::approvalCreationMode","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_approvalCreationMode","d":"<p>How a model implementing GatesCreation holds a creation until it's approved.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::approvalDraftColumn","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_approvalDraftColumn","d":"<p>The boolean column marking a row as waiting for approval in draft mode.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::requiresApprovalWhen","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_requiresApprovalWhen","d":"<p>Rule that decides when an approval process should be triggered for\nthis model. Override directly, or define a <code>requiresApprovalWhenTrait</code>\nmethod to keep this concern free for other traits to compose.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::approvableItemGroups","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_approvableItemGroups","d":"<p>Opt-in: return the field groups that should be decided independently\nof one another, e.g. ['rules' =&gt; ['rules'], 'notes' =&gt; ['notes']].</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::modifications","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_modifications","d":"<p>The modifications recorded for this model.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::creations","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_creations","d":"<p>Every creation recorded for this model, decided or not.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::pendingCreations","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_pendingCreations","d":"<p>Creations of this model still waiting for a decision. In deferred mode this is the only way\nto reach them, since there's no model yet to ask for its modifications().</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::modifier","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_modifier","d":"<p>Returns the model that should be recorded as the author of the change.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::applyModificationChanges","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_applyModificationChanges","d":"<p>Carry out a decision on a modification. Votes call this once they reach the required count.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::applyModificationItemChanges","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_applyModificationItemChanges","d":"<p>Applies (or rejects) a single ModificationItem's proposed values,\ntouching only the fields captured in that item.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::isForcedApprovalUpdate","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_isForcedApprovalUpdate","d":"<p>Whether the next save skips the approval gate.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::setForcedApprovalUpdate","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_setForcedApprovalUpdate","d":"<p>Make the next save skip the approval gate. It covers that save only.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::requiresApproval","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_requiresApproval","d":"<p>Gate this instance with a callback on every later save.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::noSaveModifications","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_noSaveModifications","d":"<p>Stop recording audit rows for this instance's direct saves.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::withModificationMeta","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_withModificationMeta","d":"<p>Attach <code>meta</code> to the next Modification this instance produces.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::withFullSaveModification","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_withFullSaveModification","d":"<p>Record the full attribute set instead of only the changed attributes.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::withFullSaveOnlyUpdateModification","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_withFullSaveOnlyUpdateModification","d":"<p>Record the full attribute set, but only when an attribute changed.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::forceModification","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_forceModification","d":"<p>Make the next save produce a Modification even if nothing changed, to record or decide something\noutside the columns: an applied audit row, or a pending request if the gate holds the save.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::withOperationId","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_withOperationId","d":"<p>Tag the next Modifications of this instance with a shared operation id.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::currentOperationId","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_currentOperationId","d":"<p>The operation id set with withOperationId().</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::getLastModification","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_getLastModification","d":"<p>The last Modification this instance created or matched.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::setLastModification","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_setLastModification","d":"<p>Set what getLastModification() returns.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::recordModification","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_recordModification","d":"<p>Explicit history API for events that don't go through <code>saving</code>\n(creation, deletion, attachments, signatures, external integrations).</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::captureSave","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_captureSave","d":"<p>Hold a save behind a pending Modification.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns\\RequiresApprovalWhenChanges::captureModification","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns/RequiresApprovalWhenChanges.html#method_captureModification","d":"<p>Prepare the audit row of a direct save, written once the save goes through.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts\\Approvable::modifications","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts/Approvable.html#method_modifications","d":"<p>The modifications recorded for this model.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts\\Approvable::applyModificationChanges","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts/Approvable.html#method_applyModificationChanges","d":"<p>Carry out a decision on a modification, once enough votes are in. Runs in the vote's transaction.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts\\Approver::approve","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts/Approver.html#method_approve","d":"<p>Vote to approve a modification.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts\\Approver::disapprove","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts/Approver.html#method_disapprove","d":"<p>Vote to reject a modification.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts\\Approver::approvals","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts/Approver.html#method_approvals","d":"<p>The approvals cast by this model.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts\\Approver::disapprovals","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts/Approver.html#method_disapprovals","d":"<p>The disapprovals cast by this model.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts\\GatesCreation::requiresApprovalOnCreate","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts/GatesCreation.html#method_requiresApprovalOnCreate","d":"<p>Whether creating a model with these attributes needs approval.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts\\GatesCreation::approvalCreationMode","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts/GatesCreation.html#method_approvalCreationMode","d":"<p>How a creation is held until it's approved.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts\\GatesCreation::approvalDraftColumn","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts/GatesCreation.html#method_approvalDraftColumn","d":"<p>The boolean column marking a row as waiting for approval in draft mode.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Approval::approver","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Approval.html#method_approver","d":"<p>The model that cast this vote.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Approval::modification","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Approval.html#method_modification","d":"<p>The modification this vote belongs to.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Approval::modificationItem","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Approval.html#method_modificationItem","d":"<p>The item this vote is on, if it isn't on the whole modification.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Disapproval::disapprover","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Disapproval.html#method_disapprover","d":"<p>The model that cast this vote.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Disapproval::modification","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Disapproval.html#method_modification","d":"<p>The modification this vote belongs to.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Disapproval::modificationItem","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Disapproval.html#method_modificationItem","d":"<p>The item this vote is on, if it isn't on the whole modification.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::casts","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_casts","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::booted","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_booted","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::modifiable","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_modifiable","d":"<p>The model this change belongs to.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::modifier","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_modifier","d":"<p>The model recorded as the author of the change.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::approvals","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_approvals","d":"<p>The approvals cast on this modification and on its items.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::disapprovals","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_disapprovals","d":"<p>The disapprovals cast on this modification and on its items.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::items","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_items","d":"<p>The separately decidable parts of this change, if the model defines any.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::getApproversRemainingAttribute","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_getApproversRemainingAttribute","d":"<p>Approvals still missing, read as <code>approvers_remaining</code>. Votes on items don't count.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::getDisapproversRemainingAttribute","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_getDisapproversRemainingAttribute","d":"<p>Disapprovals still missing, read as <code>disapprovers_remaining</code>. Votes on items don't count.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::getApprovalsRemainingAttribute","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_getApprovalsRemainingAttribute","d":""},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::getDisapprovalsRemainingAttribute","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_getDisapprovalsRemainingAttribute","d":""},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::isPending","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_isPending","d":"<p>Whether this row is still waiting for a decision. Anything else, including a direct audit\nrow, can't take a vote: applying it again would overwrite whatever changed since.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::isCreation","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_isCreation","d":"<p>Whether this requests or records a new row, not a change to an existing one.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::modifiableClass","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_modifiableClass","d":"<p>The modifiable class, resolving a morph alias.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::modifiableWithDrafts","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_modifiableWithDrafts","d":"<p>The modifiable, including a row hidden while its creation waits for approval,\nwhich the <code>modifiable</code> relation can't see.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::forceApprovalUpdate","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_forceApprovalUpdate","d":"<p>Skips the votes, not the rules: only a pending change can be forced, and a rejected item\nstays rejected. Anything else would overwrite whatever changed since it was decided.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::forceApprovalCreate","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_forceApprovalCreate","d":"<p>forceApprovalUpdate() for a creation, refusing anything else: a query that went wrong\nmust not apply a change to an existing row under this name.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::syncLegacyFlags","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_syncLegacyFlags","d":"<p>Derives the legacy <code>active</code>/<code>is_modification</code> booleans from <code>flow</code>/\n<code>status</code>, so old consumers reading those columns keep working without\nchanges: direct/applied =&gt; inactive audit row; approval/pending =&gt;\nactive pending row; approval/approved|rejected|partially_resolved =&gt;\ninactive, resolved row.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::recalculateStatusFromItems","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_recalculateStatusFromItems","d":"<p>Recomputes this modification's status from its items' statuses.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::scopeActiveOnly","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_scopeActiveOnly","d":"<p>Only the rows flagged <code>active</code>, which are the pending ones.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::scopeInactiveOnly","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_scopeInactiveOnly","d":"<p>Only the rows not flagged <code>active</code>: audit rows and decided changes.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::scopeChanges","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_scopeChanges","d":"<p>Only changes to existing rows.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\Modification::scopeCreations","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/Modification.html#method_scopeCreations","d":"<p>Only creations.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\ModificationItem::casts","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/ModificationItem.html#method_casts","d":null},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\ModificationItem::modification","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/ModificationItem.html#method_modification","d":"<p>The modification this item is part of.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\ModificationItem::approvals","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/ModificationItem.html#method_approvals","d":"<p>The approvals cast on this item.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\ModificationItem::disapprovals","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/ModificationItem.html#method_disapprovals","d":"<p>The disapprovals cast on this item.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\ModificationItem::getApproversRemainingAttribute","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/ModificationItem.html#method_getApproversRemainingAttribute","d":"<p>Approvals still missing, read as <code>approvers_remaining</code>.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\ModificationItem::getDisapproversRemainingAttribute","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/ModificationItem.html#method_getDisapproversRemainingAttribute","d":"<p>Disapprovals still missing, read as <code>disapprovers_remaining</code>.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models\\ModificationItem::scopePending","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models/ModificationItem.html#method_scopePending","d":"<p>Only the items waiting for a decision.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Scopes\\ApprovalDraftScope::apply","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Scopes/ApprovalDraftScope.html#method_apply","d":"<p>Leave out rows waiting for approval, on a model in draft mode.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Scopes\\ApprovalDraftScope::extend","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Scopes/ApprovalDraftScope.html#method_extend","d":"<p>Add the <code>withApprovalDrafts()</code> and <code>onlyApprovalDrafts()</code> query methods.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Support\\ResolvesApprovalModels::modificationClass","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Support/ResolvesApprovalModels.html#method_modificationClass","d":"<p>The class to use for modifications, from <code>approvals.models.modification</code>.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Support\\ResolvesApprovalModels::modificationItemClass","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Support/ResolvesApprovalModels.html#method_modificationItemClass","d":"<p>The class to use for modification items, from <code>approvals.models.modification_item</code>.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Support\\