\GatesCreation::approvalCreationMode","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts/GatesCreation.html#method_approvalCreationMode","d":"<p>How a creation is held until it's approved.</p>"},{"t":"M","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts\\GatesCreation::approvalDraftColumn","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts/GatesCreation.html#method_approvalDraftColumn","d":"<p>The boolean column marking a row as waiting for approval in draft mode.</p>"},{"t":"N","n":"ReynoTECH","p":"ReynoTECH.html"},{"t":"N","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals.html"},{"t":"N","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Concerns","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Concerns.html"},{"t":"N","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Contracts","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Contracts.html"},{"t":"N","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Models","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Models.html"},{"t":"N","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Scopes","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Scopes.html"},{"t":"N","n":"ReynoTECH\\Approvals\\Support","p":"ReynoTECH/Approvals/Support.html"}]}
